# Apps

A collection of four apps. Download the apps from the [Releases page](../../releases).

## Available apps

| App | Description |
| --- | --- |
| **QRCode_Coder** | Create QR codes. |
| **QRCode_Scanner** | Scan QR codes. |
| **TextEditor** | Edit text. |
| **Voice_Dictate** | Dictate text using your voice. |

## Download

1. Open the [Releases page](../../releases).
2. Select the latest release.
3. Under **Assets**, download the file for the app you want.

Each app is available as a separate download.
